  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Printed on 20 double leaves folded at the fore-edge. The text is printed over close-up illustrations of stacks of books.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A miniature book housed in a copper locket and issued in a cloth-covered box. The locket also opens to reveal illustrations of a Baghdad bookseller's stall before the bombings in 2007 and woven strips printed with text from the preambles of the United States and Iraq constitutions.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Written and designed by Julie Chen. The copper locket was fabricated by Christina Kemp"--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
